* 18/03/2018 : Initial discovery
* 17/04/2018 : Contact with the editor
* 17/04/2018 : Editor acknowledges the vulnerability
* 18/04/2018 : Editor announces fixes in version 7.0.2
* 21/05/2018 : Vulnerability disclosure

